n recombines."},{"sids":["arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::apic_ap_setup","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::init_apic_mappings","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::apic_force_enable","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::disconnect_bsp_APIC","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::apic_is_clustered_box","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::up_late_init"],"text":"Boot services: secondary setup, mapping init, forced enable, legacy disconnect with fixed low vector and edge active-high LVT, chassis query, late arming. Chassis repeat-safe, others early single-threaded."}],"extracts":["aebe94685da5cc49f83f6db49bdae43c936c3b5b589dbaca2979f0a05502c91f","dd329b9de958f85a1c52eb425a72ef306c205054448b4e5b8ed7aa853183a059"],"gpl_spec":"PASS","hazards":[{"sids":["arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::try_to_enable_x2apic.alt_1","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::x2apic_disable","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::setup_nox2apic","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::__irq_msi_compose_msg","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::handle_spurious_interrupt","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::DEFINE_IDTENTRY_SYSVEC.alt_2","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::DEFINE_IDTENTRY_SYSVEC.alt_3","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::lapic_resume"],"text":"Legacy bound 255, incompatible at and above; with hypervisor dest 32767 allowing below 32768. Spurious 0xFF never acked, low nibble 0xF on restore, others ack only if pending with 5-bit grouping. Error decodes low 8 bits, double-clears around resume with large-table guard. Unrepresentable disable halts, locked warns, wide MSI warns once. MSI low dest 8 bits."},{"sids":["arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_noop.c::noop_apic_read","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_noop.c::noop_apic_write"],"text":"Noop reads return zero, writes do nothing, warning once when boot advertises APIC while disabled flag clear."}],"invariants":[{"sids":["arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::x2apic_disable","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::x2apic_hw_locked","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::setup_nox2apic","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::__x2apic_enable.alt_1","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::__x2apic_disable.alt_1","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::__x2apic_enable.alt_2","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::__x2apic_disable.alt_2","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::try_to_enable_x2apic.alt_2"],"text":"Disable halts on unrepresentable id, warns on locked hw. No-x2apic checks then clears capability. Base toggles idempotent. Without support, selection and toggles empty."},{"sids":["arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::apic_set_verbosity","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::apic_set_extnmi","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::lapic_insert_resource","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_common.c::default_init_apic_ldr"],"text":"Verbosity handles absent arg and named levels, fails invalid. Ext-NMI matches all, none, boot-only. Resource needs base else one page. LDR selects flat then merges id."},{"sids":["arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::handle_spurious_interrupt","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::DEFINE_IDTENTRY_SYSVEC.alt_3","arch/x86/kernel/irq.c::irq_stat_inc_and_enable","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::multi_checked","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::multi","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::set_multi","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::multi_dmi_table","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic.c::dmi_check_multi"],"text":"Spurious counts, never acks arch value, acks others only if service pending. Error tickles if table large, samples, acks, counts low byte. Clustered is one-shot DMI with cached flag."},{"sids":["arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_flat_64.c::physflat_get_apic_id","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_flat_64.c::physflat_probe","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_flat_64.c::physflat_acpi_madt_oem_check","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_noop.c::noop_send_IPI","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_noop.c::noop_send_IPI_mask","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_noop.c::noop_send_IPI_mask_allbutself","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_noop.c::noop_send_IPI_allbutself","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_noop.c::noop_send_IPI_all","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_noop.c::noop_send_IPI_self","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_noop.c::noop_apic_icr_write","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_noop.c::noop_wakeup_secondary_cpu","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_noop.c::noop_apic_icr_read","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_noop.c::noop_get_apic_id","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_noop.c::noop_apic_eoi","arch/x86/kernel/apic/init.c::apic_setup_apic_calls","arch/x86/kernel/apic/init.c::DEFINE_APIC_CALL","arch/x86/kernel/apic/init.c::__initdata","arch/x86/kernel/apic/ipi.c::__default_send_IPI_dest_field","arch/x86/kernel/apic/ipi.c::__prepare_ICR2","arch/x86/kernel/apic/local.h::__prepare_ICR","arch/x86/kernel/apic/hw_nmi.c::hw_nmi_get_sample_period","arch/x86/kernel/apic/hw_nmi.c::nmi_raise_cpu_backtrace","arch/x86/kernel/apic/hw_nmi.c::arch_trigger_cpumask_backtrace","arch/x86/kernel/apic/hw_nmi.c::nmi_cpu_backtrace_handler"],"text":"Flat claims all, physical mode, native ops with waits, dest from mapping, offline NMI allowed. Noop sends inert, cmd reads zero, wakeup fails, logical mode. Static copies EOI, refreshes calls. Dest IPI waits idle then programs. Cmd NMI for NMI vector else fixed. Sample scales clock. Backtrace via mask NMI."},{"sids":["arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_numachip.c::numachip1_get_apic_id","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_numachip.c::numachip2_get_apic_id","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_numachip.c::__read_mostly","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_numachip.c::apic_numachip1","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_numachip.c::apic_numachip2","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_numachip.c::numachip_apic_icr_write","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_numachip.c::numachip1_apic_icr_write","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_numachip.c::numachip2_apic_icr_write","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_numachip.c::numachip_wakeup_secondary","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_numachip.c::numachip_system_init","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_numachip.c::numachip_send_IPI_mask","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_numachip.c::numachip_send_IPI_mask_allbutself","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_numachip.c::numachip_send_IPI_allbutself","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_numachip.c::numachip_send_IPI_all","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_numachip.c::numachip_send_IPI_self","arch/x86/kernel/apic/apic_numachip.c::numac